{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日、\n個別握手だったよ♡！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私服"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"#tops merryjenny\n#pants ENVYM\n#sandals merryjenny"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうかな？⌒(。∵。)⌒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～P生誕祭～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱい\n生誕委員の方が頑張ってくれて....\n素敵な生誕祭でした>_<。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンも作るん大変やったんやろうな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいかった、、\nお花とかメッセージとかもありがとう。\nスタイルブックみたいなのも作ってくれてて、うれしかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読むの楽しい！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕委員の方が、\n私の大好きなミスiDの方々に協力していただいてメッセージとかもらってくれてて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小林司さん、ゆうこすからメッセージ、\n水野しずさんから絵を、\n黒宮れいちゃんと金子りえちゃんから色紙、\nミスiDの方々からたくさんメッセージの書かれた色紙(まだお話したことのない方からもいただいて..>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"など本当に本当にうれしかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのプレゼントをいただきました、幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早速おうちにかざってる、、、\nしずさんが私を書いてくださるなんて\n嬉しすぎて嬉しすぎて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小林さんに素敵なコメントをもらっちゃったからあのミスiD審査委員からの評価コメントみたいで、ミスiDなんじゃないかって思ってきた。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に幸せだよ～～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆうりが\n手紙読んでくれたのも\nとってもうれしかった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも仲良くしてねっ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな大好き。\n出会ってくれてありがとう！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2016/04/21/6666811/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまひなはね、\nアンダーライブの東北ツアー真っ只中。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は岩手。頑張るぞー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コールは「かわごー」\nサイリウムは、ハート型\n(または赤)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また\nアンダーライブのおはなしは\n今度書くね～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいぴち☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":">>>ブログ以外に755をやっています。ぜひ覗いてみてね～<<<"}],"source":"archive"}